flowchart TD
    A0([From main flow: Take the interest check-in]) --> A1["Intro: 12 short questions in 4 groups.<br/>You can skip any question, go back, or stop at any time.<br/>Parents and counselors: answer together with the student, not for them"]
    A1 --> Q[/"Question n of 12 with answer cards and a Not sure or Skip button"/]
    Q --> V{"Valid answer?"}
    V -->|Yes| SAVE["Save the answer and update What I understood so far"]
    V -->|"No: typed text or incomplete choice"| IV{"Invalid attempts on this question: fewer than 2?"}
    IV -->|Yes| HINT["Error recovery: show a short hint and re-ask the same question with the answer cards"]
    HINT --> Q
    IV -->|"No: 2 reached"| OFF["Offer to skip this question and mark it as skipped"]
    OFF --> NXT
    Q -->|Not sure or Skip| SK["Mark as skipped. Not counted in scoring"]
    SK --> NXT
    Q -->|Back| PREV["Show the previous question with its saved answer, which can be edited.<br/>On question 1, stay on question 1"]
    PREV --> Q
    Q -->|Stop| EXIT([Return to hub. Answers are kept for this session])
    SAVE --> NXT{"More questions?"}
    NXT -->|Yes| Q
    NXT -->|No| CNT{"How many questions were answered?"}
    CNT -->|"6 to 12"| OKN["Show how many were skipped, if any"]
    OKN --> SCORE
    CNT -->|"1 to 5"| WARN["Warning: most questions were skipped, so the suggestions may be less reliable"]
    WARN --> WQ[["Quick replies: Go back and answer more / Show anyway with a low-accuracy notice / Return to hub"]]
    WQ -->|Go back and answer more| Q
    WQ -->|Show anyway with a low-accuracy notice| SCORE
    WQ -->|Return to hub| EXIT
    CNT -->|0| ZERO["No answers, so no suggestions can be made"]
    ZERO --> WQ0[["Quick replies: Start the questions / Return to hub"]]
    WQ0 -->|Start the questions| Q
    WQ0 -->|Return to hub| EXIT
    SCORE["Run the rule-based scoring (deterministic)"] --> OK{"Scoring succeeded?"}
    OK -->|Yes| OUT([To main flow: Suggestions])
    OK -->|No| ERRX([To main flow: Subflow C Technical error recovery])
